Third-party code
================

src/link.rs contains code adapted from the following projects, used under
the MIT License. Their copyright and permission notices are reproduced
below as that license requires.

- pbpctrl, https://github.com/qzed/pbpctrl
  (Maestro RFCOMM profile connection, from cli/src/bt.rs; pbpctrl is
  dual-licensed MIT or Apache-2.0, used here under MIT)

- omarchy-pixelbuds, https://github.com/alinuxfan/omarchy-pixelbuds
  (session, reconnect and settings handling, from
  daemon/pixelbudsd/src/maestro_link.rs)

The `maestro` crate from pbpctrl is a build dependency, not included in this
repository, and is likewise used under MIT.

